>>
Rule 5 (contracting dimensions of input tensors must match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2)) ∨ (ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, 0)) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 2)) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0))
